 "summary": "Eight single Schottky rectifiers in the flat SOD-123FL surface-mount package, each rated 3.0 A average forward current and 80 A for one 8.3 ms half-sine surge, with peak reverse voltage from 20 V (DSK32) to 200 V (DSK320). Maximum forward voltage at 3 A climbs with the voltage grade, from 0.55 V to 0.95 V. Named uses are fast switching, circuit protection and voltage clamping. DSK310 is the 100 V grade, marked K310.",
